Signed and timestamped measurement campaigns live under measurements/ and carry
their own OpenPGP signatures (.asc), RFC 3161 timestamps (.tsr) and
OpenTimestamps proofs (.ots). Redistributing a campaign without its proofs
removes the only thing that makes it verifiable.
